note Stale until proven current. Several symbols in one file can share a name; the one whose text still hashes right wins, so a step on StepChange::tag no longer lands on Author::tag. A resolved but changed slice keeps its lines so the reader sees where it was; a gone file or symbol leaves the previous lines untouched.

