hash 4031754fbc3cfa3a
note repin: every stale step in turn, its file read once from the revision (default: the parent revision, @- in jj or HEAD in git) and kept for the steps after it. A step that follows is pinned through pin_anchor like path-pin; one that does not stays stale with the reason printed. The output is the review: each re-pinned step with changed text prints its removed and added lines, and its note has to be reread against them.

