note stale and check share the listing; check turns a non-empty list into an Err so the process exits 2. Each stale step gets a hint: a ready-made path-pin when its text merely moved, or every symbol of the same name anywhere when the symbol is gone from its file. A link to a path the map does not have is listed after them and fails check the same way.
